"""Unit tests for FlextJWTService module - JWT token operations.

Tests cover JWT token generation, validation, refresh operations,
and convenience functions for JWT handling.

Copyright (c) 2025 Flext. All rights reserved.
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
